# M7: insert a BMP and a PNG, save as .QLD, open the saved file again and see both pictures as shaded boxes.
@copy pic.bmp
@copy pic.png
f10 right right enter             # Insert > Picture...
p i c period b m p enter
enter
f10 right right enter
p i c period p n g enter
f10 down down down enter          # File > Save As...
o u t period q l d enter
f10 down enter                    # File > Open...
o u t period q l d enter
f10 end enter    # File > Exit
